docs {
  `GET /v1/files`

  302 redirect to a short-lived signed URL of the object. Honors per-purpose read capabilities. Refused for support principals.

  - **Auth:** Bearer access token (`{{accessToken}}`, set by `auth/Login`)
  - **Listeners:** internal
  - **Success:** `302`
  - **Query `key`** (required): object key
}
